<body>
  <%- include('./partials/nav') %>
  <main class="container-fluid p-3 info-container">
    <div class="radio-hero">
      <div class="radio-hero-icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" width="80" height="80" fill="none">
        <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="36" stroke="var(--orange2)" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.25"/>
        <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="26" stroke="var(--blue6)" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.35"/>
        <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="16" stroke="var(--orange3)" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.5"/>
        <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="5" fill="var(--orange2)"/>
        <path d="M52 28a18 18 0 0 1 0 24" stroke="var(--orange3)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" class="radio-wave radio-wave-1"/>
        <path d="M56 22a26 26 0 0 1 0 36" stroke="var(--blue6)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" class="radio-wave radio-wave-2"/>
        <path d="M60 16a34 34 0 0 1 0 48" stroke="var(--orange2)" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" class="radio-wave radio-wave-3"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h1>Set the scene. Share the soundtrack.</h1>
      <p>Choose music for the road ahead, the mystery unfolding, or the battle about to begin.</p>
      <p>Far Reach Radio streams session music in sync through one listener link. Your players open it, press play, and listen together.</p>
      <div class="seo-cta-block"><a class="seo-cta-primary" href="https://radio.farreachco.com">Open Far Reach Radio</a>
        <p><small>Hosting requires a free Far Reach Co. account. Listeners don’t need accounts.</small></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <section id="playlist-library">
      <h2>From tavern to final battle</h2>
      <p>Find music organized around the scenes you run:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Combat:</strong> bring energy to a skirmish or a major confrontation.</li>
        <li><strong>Exploration:</strong> accompany wilderness journeys, dungeon crawls, and unfamiliar roads.</li>
        <li><strong>Taverns and towns:</strong> leave room for conversation and downtime.</li>
        <li><strong>Horror:</strong> build tension when something feels wrong.</li>
        <li><strong>Mystery:</strong> support investigation, secrets, and intrigue.</li>
        <li><strong>Victory:</strong> give the party’s achievements a moment to land.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The catalog includes more than 200 original pieces. Free accounts have access to the standard library; Pro unlocks the full catalog and exclusive playlists.</p>
      <a class="seo-cta-secondary" href="/pricing">See plans</a>
    </section>
    <section id="host-workflow">
      <h2>Your soundtrack in three steps</h2>
      <h3>1. Start a channel</h3>
      <p>Sign in and enter a channel name to open the host panel.</p>
      <h3>2. Choose a playlist</h3>
      <p>Pick the mood for your current scene. Switch playlists or skip tracks as the adventure changes.</p>
      <h3>3. Share the listener link</h3>
      <p>Send it through Discord, text, or email. Players open the link and press play to join the stream.</p>
      <figure class="toolshot-card">
        <img src="/assets/screen_shots/radio_host_control.png" alt="Far Reach Radio host panel with playlist controls and listener link." loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption>Choose a playlist and share the listener link from the host panel.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>
    <section id="why-radio">
      <h2>Keep the music close at hand</h2>
      <p>Control playlists, skip tracks, and stop playback from one browser tab.</p>
      <p>There’s no Discord bot to install or configure. Keep talking wherever your group already meets, and share the music through Radio.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="online-and-in-person">
      <h2>Play online or around the same table</h2>
      <p>For remote sessions, send each player the listener link.</p>
      <p>For in-person games, open the listener link on a device connected to your speakers and control the music from your laptop or phone.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="faq">
      <h2>A few things to know</h2>
      <h3>Do my players need accounts?</h3>
      <p>No. Only the host needs to sign in.</p>
      <h3>Does the music stop if I close the host panel?</h3>
      <p>No. Streaming continues while listeners are connected. The stream goes idle after ten minutes without listeners.</p>
      <h3>Can someone else take over the music?</h3>
      <p>Yes. Another signed-in user can open the host panel using the same channel name and control playback.</p>
      <h3>What’s included for free?</h3>
      <p>The standard music library. Pro adds access to the full catalog, including additional exclusive playlists.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="get-started">
      <h2>Bring your next scene to life</h2>
      <div class="seo-cta-block"><a class="seo-cta-primary" href="https://radio.farreachco.com">Open Far Reach Radio</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <%- include('./partials/footer') %>
</body>

</html>
